@comment{
  Add AI-related lab publications here as BibTeX entries below. This page is
  hidden (nav: false in _pages/publications.md) until there's a real AI paper
  to show -- flip that back to nav: true whenever you're ready to publish it.

  Template -- copy this, fill in the fields, done:

  @article{citekey2026,
    title={Paper Title},
    author={Last, First and Last, First},
    journal={Journal Name},
    volume={1},
    number={1},
    pages={1--10},
    year={2026},
    doi={10.xxxx/xxxxx}
  }

  citekey can be anything unique (e.g. lastname+year, no spaces). The doi
  field auto-generates a working link on the page. Grab the citation details
  from PubMed, Google Scholar, or the journal's page.
}
